      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CUT. it failed its own test: asked whether any\nquestion had ever needed answering that the CODE\ncould not answer, the answer was no. a document\nrestating mechanism is a second source that drifts,\nand a drifted doc answers confidently and wrongly.",
      "fontSize": 12,
