    {
      "id": "t1138",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 770,
      "y": 3654,
      "width": 349.8,
      "height": 45.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0138",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17966,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 34794,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the open work \u2014 everything not yet done, from every\nrelease grouping. plus, for each item, the VALUE that\nframing declared for it.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the open work \u2014 everything not yet done, from every\nrelease grouping. plus, for each item, the VALUE that\nframing declared for it.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t1139",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1190,
      "y": 3654,
      "width": 376.20000000000005,
      "height": 210.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0139",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17973,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 34807,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the failure is NOT bad ranking. it is that the items are\nnot in a form you can weigh. three things missing, and\nonly one of them is about order:\n  NO DIAGRAM         \u2014 rendered, not prose\n  NO CLEAR STRUCTURE \u2014 same shape per item, so they are\n                       actually comparable\n  NO CLEAR ASK       \u2014 what decision is wanted, per item\n\n'too much noise' is not volume. a list of prose titles\ngives you nothing to weigh, however short it is.\n\nitems BLOCKED on a dependency are not candidates at all \u2014\na dependency is a hard constraint, so they cannot be\n'next' at any consequence. draw them apart.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the failure is NOT bad ranking. it is that the items are\nnot in a form you can weigh. three things missing, and\nonly one of them is about order:\n  NO DIAGRAM         \u2014 rendered, not prose\n  NO CLEAR STRUCTURE \u2014 same shape per item, so they are\n                       actually comparable\n  NO CLEAR ASK       \u2014 what decision is wanted, per item\n\n'too much noise' is not volume. a list of prose titles\ngives you nothing to weigh, however short it is.\n\nitems BLOCKED on a dependency are not candidates at all \u2014\na dependency is a hard constraint, so they cannot be\n'next' at any consequence. draw them apart.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t1140",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1610,
      "y": 3654,
      "width": 382.8,
      "height": 255.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0140",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17980,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 34820,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "candidates on TWO CONSTANT AXES, both about OUTCOME:\n  CONSEQUENCE \u2014 what it costs us NOT to do it\n  VALUE       \u2014 what we gain by doing it. already declared\n                by Frame the intent and already used by\n                Test viability. third caller, not a new\n                measure.\n\nand, per item, WHAT WE LOSE by not choosing it. v0.68's\nrule applied to work: name the loss, or it disappears into\nthe good news. a ranked list shows what you picked and\nnever what you gave up.\n\nEFFORT IS NOT AN AXIS. it is an INPUT measure beside two\nOUTCOME measures, which makes the grid incoherent, and it\nsystematically flatters cheap work. it survives as a\ntiebreaker inside a cell, and as one of the five slicing\nfactors at Slice a release.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "candidates on TWO CONSTANT AXES, both about OUTCOME:\n  CONSEQUENCE \u2014 what it costs us NOT to do it\n  VALUE       \u2014 what we gain by doing it. already declared\n                by Frame the intent and already used by\n                Test viability. third caller, not a new\n                measure.\n\nand, per item, WHAT WE LOSE by not choosing it. v0.68's\nrule applied to work: name the loss, or it disappears into\nthe good news. a ranked list shows what you picked and\nnever what you gave up.\n\nEFFORT IS NOT AN AXIS. it is an INPUT measure beside two\nOUTCOME measures, which makes the grid incoherent, and it\nsystematically flatters cheap work. it survives as a\ntiebreaker inside a cell, and as one of the five slicing\nfactors at Slice a release.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "t1141",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2030,
      "y": 3654,
      "width": 363.00000000000006,
      "height": 135.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0141",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 17987,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 34833,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MACHINE: every candidate carries consequence, value and\nits loss. blocked items are separated, not ranked. the\nview is RENDERED \u2014 prose fails this by construction.\n\nHUMAN: Tony can weigh them at a glance and say which.\n\nthe test is not 'is the ranking right'. it is 'can he\ncompare them at all'. an item he cannot understand\nwithout opening it fails, however well it is ranked.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MACHINE: every candidate carries consequence, value and\nits loss. blocked items are separated, not ranked. the\nview is RENDERED \u2014 prose fails this by construction.\n\nHUMAN: Tony can weigh them at a glance and say which.\n\nthe test is not 'is the ranking right'. it is 'can he\ncompare them at all'. an item he cannot understand\nwithout opening it fails, however well it is ranked.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      }
    },
