      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "one piece of the work order, under the two-tier rule:\nthe exact spec \u2014 scope, the why, its own check \u2014 plus\naccess to related materials. AND NO MORE.",
