      "text": "conformance PER LAYER, never one verdict: code \u00b7 logic \u00b7\narchitecture \u00b7 pixel vs the approved design \u00b7 the\nproduct measurements from stage 1.\n\nand the verdicts can BLOCK. the rung-wide property:\nevery gate here refuses from OUTSIDE the model \u2014\nadvisory output is not a check. (today: 0 CI workflows,\n0 pre-commit hooks, every repo. every gate in the\nsystem is a model choosing to comply.)",
