      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MACHINE: every declared layer conforms, per layer.\n\nHUMAN \u2014 the EXPERT-USER pass: Tony uses the output\nitself. the app feature, the performance, the document,\nthe diagram \u2014 whatever the output finally is, checked\nas the expert user, not as a reader of reports.\n(Tony, 2026-08-03: 'im checking it as the expert user.')\n\nthis is GOAL ACHIEVED \u2014 the report the escalation\ncontract promised. the human re-enters here, and\nnowhere earlier short of an unanswerable blocker.",
