      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785400000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "8 of 14 functions interviewed. the rest carry their first-cut in/out and nothing else.\n4 gaps  \u00b7  3 built but unused  \u00b7  4 working  \u00b7  1 external  \u00b7  1 dying  \u00b7  1 cut.\n\"Route to the altitude\" is the keystone: nothing performs it, and it is what would\ndecide whether the three unused ones are ever reached at all.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "8 of 14 functions interviewed. the rest carry their first-cut in/out and nothing else.\n4 gaps  \u00b7  3 built but unused  \u00b7  4 working  \u00b7  1 external  \u00b7  1 dying  \u00b7  1 cut.\n\"Route to the altitude\" is the keystone: nothing performs it, and it is what would\ndecide whether the three unused ones are ever reached at all.",
