      "text": "ONE entry per CONCEPT, never per attempt:\nwhat was tried or considered \u00b7 why it was\neliminated \u00b7 the evidence \u00b7 the RETURN CONDITION.\nNOT the code, NOT the diff, NOT the error output \u2014\nconcepts outlive codebases. filter: was it ever a\nCANDIDATE? a slip is not an option.",
