      "text": "MUST run cold eyes over the whole change before 'goal achieved' is\ndeclared \u2014 seeing ONLY the work order and the change, no build context;\nverdict CAN BLOCK. also on-demand for risky pieces. the flaw class is\ngaps in the DECLARED TRUTH, which live at assembly, not per piece.\nMUST check every declared layer \u2014 code, logic, architecture, pixel vs\nthe approved design, product measurements \u2014 conformance per layer,\nnever one verdict.\nMUST end with the EXPERT-USER pass: the human uses the output itself \u2014\napp feature, performance, document, diagram, whatever it finally is.\nRUNG-WIDE PROPERTY: every gate here MUST block from outside the model.\nadvisory output is not a check. (today: 0 CI, 0 hooks, every repo)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MUST run cold eyes over the whole change before 'goal achieved' is\ndeclared \u2014 seeing ONLY the work order and the change, no build context;\nverdict CAN BLOCK. also on-demand for risky pieces. the flaw class is\ngaps in the DECLARED TRUTH, which live at assembly, not per piece.\nMUST check every declared layer \u2014 code, logic, architecture, pixel vs\nthe approved design, product measurements \u2014 conformance per layer,\nnever one verdict.\nMUST end with the EXPERT-USER pass: the human uses the output itself \u2014\napp feature, performance, document, diagram, whatever it finally is.\nRUNG-WIDE PROPERTY: every gate here MUST block from outside the model.\nadvisory output is not a check. (today: 0 CI, 0 hooks, every repo)",
