      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MUST be one question, drilled, carrying the findings it depends on.\n(?) MUST be agreed in diagrams, not prose \u2014 constant axes, colour marking\ncost only, bets named and discharged by name, containment over arrows,\nan altitude shift between movements.\n(?) MUST round-trip: the diagram goes out, annotations come back as\ninput, preserved across regeneration.\n(?) MUST pick a story format before drawing \u2014 proposal / compare-contrast\n(current \u2192 new \u2192 what changes) / roadmap / illumination.\n(?) needs an enforcement point \u2014 five written statements did not bind",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MUST be one question, drilled, carrying the findings it depends on.\n(?) MUST be agreed in diagrams, not prose \u2014 constant axes, colour marking\ncost only, bets named and discharged by name, containment over arrows,\nan altitude shift between movements.\n(?) MUST round-trip: the diagram goes out, annotations come back as\ninput, preserved across regeneration.\n(?) MUST pick a story format before drawing \u2014 proposal / compare-contrast\n(current \u2192 new \u2192 what changes) / roadmap / illumination.\n(?) needs an enforcement point \u2014 five written statements did not bind",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kerd"
      }
    },
